{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"Abel∞-群"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"E∞-群"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>$\\mathbb E_{\\infty}$-群又称 Abel $\\infty$-群, 是"},{"Local":{"url":"算畴","text":"算畴"}},{"Plain":" "},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-算畴","text":"$\\mathbb E_\\infty$"}},{"Plain":"上的"},{"Local":{"url":"算畴上的代数","text":"代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>见 "},{"Local":{"url":"En-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_n$-代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半∞-范畴","text":"对称幺半 ∞-范畴"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"对象的生象","text":"对象的生象"}},{"Plain":"具有 $\\mathbb E_\\infty$-代数结构.</p>\n<p>每个"},{"Local":{"url":"谱","text":"谱"}},{"Plain":"通过函子 $\\Omega^\\infty$ 给出一个 $\\mathbb E_\\infty$-群, 直观上取出非负阶的同伦信息.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"连合谱","text":"连合谱"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}